# Login health loop

On each panel `/api/auth/login`, `run_login_health_loop` probes:

- `maahed_site` (httpx + cookie jar `/data/maahed_admin_session.json`, OCR via ddddocr when needed)
- `sepidar` MCP
- bot (Bale/Telegram)
- aggregate `data` (at least one of site/sepidar ok)

If anything is down and cannot self-heal, send one Bale message to `BOT_NOTIFY_RECIPIENT` with reason_code (deduped by fingerprint). Manual trigger: `POST /api/sources/health-loop`.

## Site connector note

Production image has **no Node/Chromium**. Do not shell out to Playwright in the pod. Prefer cookie cache; refresh cookies from ops if OCR/pip is unavailable.
